<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of Saturday's English</p>
<p>premier league soccer matches:</p>
<p>Aston Villa 2 (Milosevic 39th and 63rd minutes) Arsenal 2</p>
<p>(Merson 70th, Linighan 90th). Halftime 1-0. Attendance 37,944.</p>
<p>Leeds 0 Manchester United 4 (Martyn 3rd-own goal, Butt 49th,</p>
<p>Poborsky 77th, Cantona 90th). 0-1. 39,694.</p>
<p>Liverpool 2 (Collymore 39th, McManaman 89th) Southampton 1</p>
<p>(Magilton 58th). 1-0. 39,189.</p>
<p>Middlesbrough 4 (Ravanelli 3rd and 73rd, Juninho 28th and 80th)</p>
<p>Coventry 0. 2-0. 29,811.</p>
<p>Nottingham Forest 0 Leicester 0. 24,105.</p>
<p>Sheffield Wednesday 0 Chelsea 2 (Burley 28th, Myers 83rd). 0-1.</p>
<p>30,983.</p>
<p>Tottenham 1 (Allen 28th) Newcastle 2 (Ferdinand 37th and 61st).</p>
<p>1-1. 32,535.</p>
<p>Wimbledon 4 (Ardley 33rd, Gayle 46th, Earle 59th, Ekoku 73rd)</p>
<p>Everton 0. 1-0. 13,684.</p>
